 107:Generated_Source\PSoC5/OPAlp.c **** *
 108:Generated_Source\PSoC5/OPAlp.c **** * Summary:
 109:Generated_Source\PSoC5/OPAlp.c **** *  Powers down amplifier to lowest power state.
 110:Generated_Source\PSoC5/OPAlp.c **** *
 111:Generated_Source\PSoC5/OPAlp.c **** * Parameters:
 112:Generated_Source\PSoC5/OPAlp.c **** *  void
